<p id="p3">Clic is loaded with native features. Widgets, Live Activities, Lock Screen controls, Control Center widgets, and Shortcuts for automation are all there. On the Mac you get a full app plus a menu bar companion with speaker grouping and hot keys. Scenes group your rooms, set the volume, and start the music in a single tap, and the Share Sheet sends any Apple Music or Spotify link, a song, album, artist, or station, straight to the speaker you choose.</p>
